00:28:49,860 --> 00:28:52,060
愛は計算じゃ解けない
Love can't be solved with calculations!

283
00:28:52,060 --> 00:28:54,660
まず普通の計算も解けない
First off, I can't even solve regular math!

284
00:28:54,660 --> 00:28:57,060
要は、そんな状態が愛らしい
In short, that kind of state is adorable.

285
