582
00:47:43,646 --> 00:47:51,646
Welcome Fantasia きっとここが消えないフェアリーテイル Welcome Fantasia Yes!
Welcome Fantasia! This place is surely an everlasting fairytale. Welcome Fantasia, Yes!

